---
import PostLayout from '../../layouts/PostLayout.astro';
---

<PostLayout
  pageTitle="Andaman Sands | Expeditions"
  heroTitle="Andaman<br>Sands"
  heroSubtitle="Glimpses of Thailand 2018"
  seriesLabel="Thailand &mdash; Vol. I"
  heroBgLabel="Hero image: Phuket beachfront at golden hour, Andaman coast"
  heroBgGradient="linear-gradient(135deg, #7a4a1a 0%, #4a2c0e 100%)"
  date="JANUARY 7TH, 2019"
  location="Phuket, Thailand"
  footnote="A shout-out to long-planned good times with good friends &mdash; Bhaskar, Umang, Gravy and Shivam. Prost! &copy; Zubin John"
  moreTitle="More Expeditions"
  description="Phuket sunsets, rock pools, and island hopping to Ko Phi Phi on Thailand's Andaman coast. January 2019."
>
  <Fragment slot="nav-left">Thailand</Fragment>
  <a slot="nav-right" class="back-btn" href="/expeditions/">&#8592; All Expeditions</a>

  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="text">
      <p class="lede">
        Wheels down, Thailand. The unremarkable: touchdown, customs, short-flight, quick-shower, Patong nights.
        Day 2, the scene is set to explore the pristine sands and sunsets of Phuket, pearl of Thailand's
        Andaman coast.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: PASTEL SUNSETS -->
  <section class="space-sm">
    <div class="text">
      <h2 class="section-title">Pastel Sunsets</h2>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-sm">
    <div class="text">
      <p>
        Turning your eyes west to an unspoiled horizon spills its reward in a scintillating climax to the day's
        activity. The Andaman coast at dusk is something quite particular &mdash; the sky goes through every
        shade between terracotta and pale rose before settling into a soft, bruised violet.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FULL BLEED: Sunset -->
  <section class="full-bleed">
    <figure>
      <div class="media ph" data-label="Phuket sunset looking west over the Andaman Sea &mdash; pastel horizon"></div>
    </figure>
  </section>
  <div class="text" style="margin-top:14px; padding-bottom:28px;">
    <figcaption>The Andaman coast at golden hour. Turning west is never the wrong decision.</figcaption>
  </div>

  <!-- 2-UP: Beach + sunset -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <figure>
        <div class="media ph" data-label="Pristine sand beach, Phuket &mdash; calm midday waters"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <div class="media ph" data-label="Silhouette of beach trees against Andaman sunset"></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="text" style="margin-top:14px;">
      <figcaption>Pearl of the Andaman coast. The beach at midday and the same horizon a few hours later.</figcaption>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: ROCK POOLS -->
  <section class="space-sm">
    <div class="text">
      <h2 class="section-title">Fortuitous Rock Pools</h2>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-sm">
    <div class="text">
      <p>
        A chance seaside natural rock pool beckons the weary traveller with the promise of a cool respite and
        a captivating vista. Do not underestimate the calming effects of a quick sunset dip &mdash; but look
        out for exposed oyster shells. They have been known to ruin quite a few happy tourists' days.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2+1: Rock pools -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2plus1">
      <figure>
        <div class="media ph" data-label="Natural rock pool, Phuket coastline &mdash; sunset light"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <div class="media ph" data-label="Coastal rock formation, Andaman Sea in background"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="span-2">
        <div class="media ph" data-label="Wide view of seaside rock pools at golden hour, Phuket"></div>
        <figcaption>
          The rock pools along the Phuket coastline offer a natural respite &mdash; and one of the finest spots
          to watch the sun disappear into the Andaman Sea.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- COVER QUOTE -->
  <section class="cover-quote">
    <div class="cover-ph" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #7a4a1a 0%, #4a2c0e 100%)"></div>
    <div class="inner">
      <figure>
        <p class="quote">Speaking of diving in &mdash; Day 3 on the open sea.</p>
        <figcaption>Ko Phi Phi Don, Andaman Sea, Thailand</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: OPEN SEA -->
  <section class="space-sm" style="padding-top:44px;">
    <div class="text">
      <h2 class="section-title">Day 3 on the Open Sea</h2>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-sm">
    <div class="text">
      <p>
        A trip to coastal Thailand is incomplete without the cliched yet essential island-hopping boat tours.
        Set yourself for a day of sun, spray and authentic Thai entertainment. Kick back and enjoy the bumpy
        ride as the tour guides regale you with their flavour of pop-culture-infused history of the island
        locals.
      </p>
      <p>
        A few boat stops along the likes of Ko Phi Phi Don and Ko Phi Phi Le and our trip to the coast
        concludes &mdash; shuttle ride back to the hotel, eyes set on Bangkok.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- GRID 3: Island hopping -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <figure>
        <div class="media ph" data-label="Limestone karsts rising from the Andaman Sea, Ko Phi Phi"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <div class="media ph" data-label="Long-tail boat approaching Ko Phi Phi Don jetty"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <div class="media ph" data-label="Turquoise waters between islands, Ko Phi Phi Le"></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="text" style="margin-top:14px;">
      <figcaption>
        The iconic limestone karsts of Ko Phi Phi Don and Ko Phi Phi Le &mdash; everything the brochure promised
        and then some.
      </figcaption>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SINGLE: Panorama -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="single">
      <figure>
        <div class="media ph" data-label="Panoramic view of Maya Bay from the cliffs above, Ko Phi Phi Le"></div>
        <figcaption>
          Maya Bay, Ko Phi Phi Le. Notoriously crowded on a map, unexpectedly serene in person.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MORE CARDS -->
  <Fragment slot="more-cards">
    <a class="more-card" href="/expeditions/bangkok/">
      <div class="more-thumb"></div>
      <p class="more-card-title">Bangkok Airwaves</p>
      <span class="more-card-badge">Published &mdash; Mar 2019</span>
      <p class="more-card-sub">Wat Pho, Wat Arun, Phra Nakhon district</p>
    </a>
    <a class="more-card" href="/expeditions/innsbruck/">
      <div class="more-thumb"></div>
      <p class="more-card-title">Into the Alps: Innsbruck</p>
      <span class="more-card-badge">Published &mdash; Oct 2021</span>
      <p class="more-card-sub">Altstadt, Nordkette, and Castle Ambras</p>
    </a>
    <a class="more-card" href="/expeditions/">
      <div class="more-thumb" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
        <span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(3,43,34,.4);">All Expeditions</span>
      </div>
      <p class="more-card-title">View All</p>
      <span class="more-card-badge">Expeditions Index</span>
      <p class="more-card-sub">Alps, Italy, and more coming soon</p>
    </a>
  </Fragment>
</PostLayout>
